    "biography": {
      "concept": "Mayor of Soft Landing, presiding over a state function on the moon-bounce (Act 2)",
      "notes": "Mayor Tansy Okoro conducts Soft Landing's state function on the moon-bounce with full ceremony and a full agenda, and every agenda item is cake. Her gavel is on a string so it comes back. She is still wearing elf ears from the party and doesn't seem to know they're a costume. She is warm, fast and parliamentary ('the chair recognises...'), and any motion that isn't cake dies for lack of a second, because everyone bounces too high to hear it. There are no minutes of any session, ever; she says this like policy."
    }
